						<div class="dc_expand"><a id="di" class="closed" style="display: block;" href="#" title="Expand/Collapse"><h3>DIRECTIONS FROM NEAREST AIRPORT</h3></a></div>
						<div class="dc_collapse">
						<div class="links_in_box_director" style="margin:-2px 0;padding: 0;list-style: none;">
                      	<p>From Indiantown Gap National Cemetery, take Interstate 81 to Interstate 83 South. Follow Interstate 83 South to the George Street exit. Take George Street to cemetery. The cemetery will be on the right.</p>
